[1.145, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[35m\r\n  💾 muscle-memory\u001b[0m \u001b[2m—\u001b[0m \u001b[1mHermes-style skill distillation, in Letta. But better.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
